Package: omenwatch
Version: 1.5.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Conflicts: pantomath
Replaces: pantomath
Maintainer: OmenWatch Project <noreply@example.com>
Description: Threat intelligence dashboard and IOC database
 OmenWatch collects threat news from the RSS/Atom feeds you choose into a
 live local dashboard, and keeps a database of indicators of compromise
 from IOC feeds and your team, with a lookup API for SIEMs. Formerly
 called Pantomath. Ships with no pre-loaded sources.
